            <span class="testimonial-mark" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
            <p class="testimonial-quote">Gary has an incredible knowledge of antiques and personal property, and is able to get higher end items to the place that they will sell best, be it an estate sale or Sotheby&rsquo;s. He can handle an estate from start to finish, and will leave the property broom clean and ready for sale, which is extremely helpful in my business! His knowledge, candor, and sense of humor can turn a difficult transition into a smooth one.</p>
            <p class="testimonial-attribution">&mdash; Molly H. | Yelp</p>
