          <div class="testimonial testimonial-secondary">
            <span class="testimonial-mark" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
            <p class="testimonial-quote">As the executor of an estate in one of SE Portland&rsquo;s historic neighborhoods, I hired Gary Germer &amp; Associates to manage the in-home estate sale. Gary and his team were professional, highly responsive, and navigated a complex situation with care and expertise. They went the extra mile to honor the memory and creative legacy of the deceased, displaying his work and treating the home with respect. The team handled the full spectrum of estate sale logistics from start to finish, a necessity for those of us who are busy professionals juggling a multitude of obligations. The estate sale itself was well-organized, well-staffed, and ran smoothly. I would not hesitate to recommend Gary Germer &amp; Associates to anyone navigating an estate sale.</p>
